  dialogNodes:
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: "Oh, greetings.. \r\n\r\nMy name is Pubert. \r\nAnd before you shall
      assume anything, yes...\r\nthat idiot prancing over there is my brother, Hubert.\r\n\r\n"
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: 
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: "You better not believe a word he says I tell you! \r\nOr else I
      would be inclined to think you're as much of an idiot as him.\r\n\r\nHe actually
      believes the tales he spins, \r\ni have no idea how they let him become a knight...\r\n\r\n\r\n"
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: 
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: '

      .... what an idiot.



'
